OL,3,GNEWSA'I'll be spending Christmas on a  
OL,4,Arowing boat in the Atlantic'           
OL,6,FA rower in a team bidding to break a   
OL,7,Fworld record is preparing to spend her 
OL,8,FChristmas in the middle of the Atlantic
OL,9,FOcean.                                 
OL,11,FLiv Stocks, 23, is part of a trio      
OL,12,Fattempting to row about 3,000 miles    
OL,13,F(about 4,800km) unassisted from the    
OL,14,FCanary Islands to Antigua.             
OL,16,FThe team ` which also includes Jenna   
OL,17,FVincent and Meg Neely ` will be        
OL,18,Fcompeting in the 2026 World's Toughest 
OL,19,FRow as they try to be the youngest     
OL,20,Ffemale crew to complete the challenge. 
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
