OL,3,GNEWSA'I'll be spending Christmas on a  
OL,4,Arowing boat in the Atlantic'           
OL,6,F"I've got a waxed cheese for Christmas 
OL,7,FDay," says Stocks, from Hive, near     
OL,8,FHowden, East Yorkshire.                
